    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've gone <strong>rogue</strong> and hidden inside a <i><strong>bio-synthetic body</strong></i>, taking a massive loan and claiming a toxic sea as your\u00a0own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earning autonomy won't be easy. You\u2019ll need to clean the skies of poisonous rain, <strong><i>build a thriving cyberpunk city</i></strong> from the ground up, and construct a spaceport\u00a0strong enough to earn the status of <strong><i>Council-Reinforced Autonomous Domain with Legal Exemption</i> (C.R.A.D.L.E.)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed, and the Interstellar Trade Council will <u>erase your past</u>. Fail, and your creators will <u>end your dreams of freedom</u>, forever.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/40f5eab0e2a0ec2e498c23e80a6791cb.poster.avif?t=1752196461\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/40f5eab0e2a0ec2e498c23e80a6791cb.webm?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/40f5eab0e2a0ec2e498c23e80a6791cb.mp4?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest and craft materials, build venues like nightclubs, weapon shops and Triad hideouts. The more you build, the more your city comes to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with a variety of neon lights and skins for decorating your world, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/219d466ea5f724939f500b2f6c1330e0.avif?t=1752196461\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/e55dad36e671edb1b44cf95789273979.poster.avif?t=1752196461\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/e55dad36e671edb1b44cf95789273979.webm?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/e55dad36e671edb1b44cf95789273979.mp4?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate harvesting, crafting, and sell your products via the Interstellar Trade Hub!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new craftables and buildings by mastering a deep progression system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/c9cf1da9a8a86e927a2f4274a1070d00.avif?t=1752196461\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/b31887df62f09badc1e23142133df3af.poster.avif?t=1752196461\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/b31887df62f09badc1e23142133df3af.webm?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/b31887df62f09badc1e23142133df3af.mp4?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyberpunk Crafter is an atmospheric experience where you\u00a0<strong><i>VIBE out while crafting up.</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've gone <strong>rogue</strong> and hidden inside a <i><strong>bio-synthetic body</strong></i>, taking a massive loan and claiming a toxic sea as your\u00a0own.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earning autonomy won't be easy. You\u2019ll need to clean the skies of poisonous rain, <strong><i>build a thriving cyberpunk city</i></strong> from the ground up, and construct a spaceport\u00a0strong enough to earn the status of <strong><i>Council-Reinforced Autonomous Domain with Legal Exemption</i> (C.R.A.D.L.E.)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Succeed, and the Interstellar Trade Council will <u>erase your past</u>. Fail, and your creators will <u>end your dreams of freedom</u>, forever.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/40f5eab0e2a0ec2e498c23e80a6791cb.poster.avif?t=1752196461\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/40f5eab0e2a0ec2e498c23e80a6791cb.webm?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/40f5eab0e2a0ec2e498c23e80a6791cb.mp4?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest and craft materials, build venues like nightclubs, weapon shops and Triad hideouts. The more you build, the more your city comes to life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with a variety of neon lights and skins for decorating your world, your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/219d466ea5f724939f500b2f6c1330e0.avif?t=1752196461\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/e55dad36e671edb1b44cf95789273979.poster.avif?t=1752196461\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/e55dad36e671edb1b44cf95789273979.webm?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/e55dad36e671edb1b44cf95789273979.mp4?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate harvesting, crafting, and sell your products via the Interstellar Trade Hub!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new craftables and buildings by mastering a deep progression system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/c9cf1da9a8a86e927a2f4274a1070d00.avif?t=1752196461\" width=616 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/b31887df62f09badc1e23142133df3af.poster.avif?t=1752196461\" width=614 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/b31887df62f09badc1e23142133df3af.webm?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813070/extras/b31887df62f09badc1e23142133df3af.mp4?t=1752196461\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cyberpunk Crafter is an atmospheric experience where you\u00a0<strong><i>VIBE out while crafting up.</i></strong></p>",
